  "post_content": "<p>El barrio Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; i Adjacents de Onda ha honrado esta tarde a Sant Josepet, dentro de sus fiestas. Una misa en la iglesia de la Asunci&oacute;n y una procesi&oacute;n desde all&iacute; y por las diferentes calles, amenizada por el Grup Dol&ccedil;ainers d&#39;Onda, ha animado la tarde.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9459.jpg\" alt=\"img_9459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9460.jpg\" alt=\"img_9460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9461.jpg\" alt=\"img_9461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9462.jpg\" alt=\"img_9462\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9463.jpg\" alt=\"img_9463\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9464.jpg\" alt=\"img_9464\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9465.jpg\" alt=\"img_9465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9466.jpg\" alt=\"img_9466\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjosepetbarricastello/img_9467.jpg\" alt=\"img_9467\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processo